 "remarks": "Within easy reach of Manhattan, 300 Sturges Ridge Rd is a private modern retreat created for an extraordinary way of living. Set on 2.6 beautifully landscaped acres adjoining protected open space, the property offers exceptional privacy in a spectacular natural setting. Walls of glass, soaring ceilings and abundant natural light create interiors that feel open and connected to the outdoors. The sophisticated Poliform kitchen is a natural gathering place for quiet evenings or a house full of friends. The private primary suite opens to a balcony overlooking the grounds, while a dramatic glass mosaic wine cellar and expansive skylit gym add unexpected spaces for everyday enjoyment. Outside, a heated saltwater pool and spa are surrounded by lush landscaping, with multiple terraces, an outdoor kitchen, fire pit and Zen garden for entertaining and unwinding. Passive solar principles, advanced HVAC, a generator and whole-property connectivity support effortless modern living. This is luxury that feels personal rather than formal-a home for summers by the pool, evenings with friends, quiet mornings surrounded by nature and weekends that feel like a true escape without ever leaving home. For those seeking a distinctive modern home or private retreat near New York City, 300 Sturges Ridge brings together exceptional design, resort-style amenities, beautiful acreage and proximity to Manhattan.",
